From HARP research branch
Subject: [PATCH 4] NR UE: select configured SNPN PLMN+NID before random access

Depends on:
  0001-nr-ue-serving-network-baseline-refactor.patch
  0002-nr-ue-snpn-serving-network-name.patch

Upstream anchor:
  openairinterface/openairinterface5g
  f8f769592a7030be88ede4bb5ca66fa1ca6a80e0

Lab UICC configuration:

  uicc0 = {
    imsi = "999990000000001";
    nmc_size = 2;
    snpn_nid = "10000000001";
    ...
  };

When snpn_nid is absent/empty, existing PLMN behavior is preserved.
When present, RRC requires an exact SIB1 SNPN match on:
  home MCC derived from IMSI
  home MNC derived from IMSI/nmc_size
  configured 44-bit NID

A mismatch returns before SIB1 validity/RA trigger is published.

